The '''Marine Fortress''' is a crescent-shaped (now anchor shaped) island northwest of [[Marine Starter Island]] that offers [[quests]] for players from [[Levels|level]] 120 to 150.

==Appearance==
The Marine Fortress is a anchor-shaped island surrounded by stone walls. The upper section of the crescent contains grassy terrain, trees, and various buildings. Four large guard towers are positioned at each corner of the structure.

The inner curve of the crescent contains a dock that leads to a tall central building where the [[Vice Admiral]] is located. Inside this building, there is an unevenly placed truss. In the frontmost left corner of the fortress, a hidden entrance leads to an area where the [[Black Cape]] accessory can be purchased.

