== Secret Quests ==

* Upon landing at the docks, turn right and head up the watchtower to find [[Parlus]]. They will ask the player to find rope to hang up his flag. The rope can be found on the most left part of the island from the dock, near a small trade stand structure and a Chief Petty Officer. After grabbing the rope, head to the flagpole next to the [[Marine]] quest-giver. The player must do a minigame where they stay in a circle to pull the flag up the pole, while being fired at by cannons.
* After waiting an 1 hour of time at Marine Fortress, a message will appear in chat saying: '''[[System Messages|''"Enemy ships are closing in on the Marine Fortress!"'']]'''  Talking to [[Parlus]] after this message appears grants a new dialogue option. When the new option is chosen, pirate [[Brigade|brigades]] will spawn outside the Marine Fortress and the player can use the turrets to shoot down every ship.  After the quest is completed, two messages will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"The raiders have been repelled! The Marine Fortress stands."'']]'''  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) drove the pirate brigade off the fortress!"'']]'''
* When [[Vice Admiral]] awakens, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"An alarm has sounded at Marine Fortress!"'']]'''  The fort cannons will start firing, destroy the top half of the center building to stop the cannons. This will start the boss sequence.  After they are defeated, a message will appear in chat saying:  '''[[System Messages|''"(Roblox username) defeated the awakened Vice Admiral!"'']]'''

==Collectibles==
* [[Black Cape]] is purchasable for {{Money|50,000}}. [[Parlus]] sells it in the Southeast tower (from the picture).
* Love Letter #3 for [[the Son Quest]] can be obtained by traversing through a maze under the castle. (The entrance is behind the castle, where a part of the rock is discolored, which can be broken with [[Instinct/Break|instinct breaking]] moves)
* Guns like [[Cannon]] ,[[Refined Slingshot]] and [[Dual Flintlock]] are being purchased here by the [[Advanced Weapon Dealer]]

==Raid Boss==
Every six hours (four hours on a new server), a message will appear in chat saying:

{{System Message|Loud tremors are being heard across the seas...}}

This message means that the raid boss [[Greybeard]] has spawned. If the player kills him when they have obtained the [[Bisento]], it will be upgraded into [[Bisento]] V2. In order to upgrade it, the player must deal at least 10% damage. The [[Bisento]] does not have to be equipped in order for it to be upgraded.

