==Trivia==
* Blade fruit is recommended to grind here beacuse of the immunity and long-ranged M1.
* If the player chooses the [[Marines]] side at the start of the game, they will be teleported right next to the castle. But for [[Pirates]], the player will spawn left or right at the end of the crescent.
** It is recommended to use the [[Marines]] side to grind the [[Vice Admiral]] here because it is closer to the castle.
* Like the [[Military Soldier]]s at [[Magma Village]], the player can get the [[Chief Petty Officer]]s stuck near the edge of the stairs and attack them while they are unable to hit the player.
* Boats on the Marine Fortress cost cheaper, even if the player is a Pirate.
* Grinding the [[Vice Admiral]] is one of the best ways to grind money in the [[First Sea]].
* The last island of a [[Phoenix]] raid is similar to Marine Fortress, but smaller.
* Before [[Update 10]], there was a scaffold and the floor texture was made of stone instead of grass.
* This island is the only island that has 2 quests but not both of them are NPCs. The first one is a [[Chief Petty Officer|NPC]] quest and the other one is a [[Vice Admiral|Boss]] quest. Many people quit here because there is no secondary NPC making it boring for new players.
* Note that the level of [[Greybeard]] is 750 which makes it difficult to defeat for [[First Sea]] players as they deal low damage to the boss.
* As of [[Updates/30|Update 30]], the island was reworked and is no longer cresent shaped.

